{"seq":3,"slug":"logs-and-telemetry-for-agents","title":"Logs And Telemetry For Agents","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/observability-and-errors-for-agents/logs-and-telemetry-for-agents","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"useful-logs-signal-over-noise","title":"有用的日志:信噪比","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/observability-and-errors-for-agents/logs-and-telemetry-for-agents/useful-logs-signal-over-noise","wordCount":1910,"readingTime":8},{"seq":2,"slug":"traces-and-context-for-debugging","title":"用于调试的链路与上下文","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/observability-and-errors-for-agents/logs-and-telemetry-for-agents/traces-and-context-for-debugging","wordCount":1741,"readingTime":7},{"seq":3,"slug":"making-telemetry-reachable","title":"让遥测够得到","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/observability-and-errors-for-agents/logs-and-telemetry-for-agents/making-telemetry-reachable","wordCount":1859,"readingTime":8}],"introMarkdown":"本章讲日志和遥测怎么做才对 agent 有用。有用的日志靠信噪比:记下真正有信号的(关键事件、状态变化、出错上下文),而非把一切都打成日志的洪流——噪音淹没信号,agent(和人)反而抓不出关键;少而精的日志比海量日志更有用。用于调试的链路与上下文:让日志/遥测带上能把一次操作串起来的上下文(请求 id、链路、关联键),让 agent 能跟着一条线索重建\"这次到底怎么走的\",而非面对一堆互不关联的碎片。让遥测够得到:再好的信号,agent 拿不到也白搭——日志要落在它能读到的地方(标准输出、可读文件、可查询接口),而非锁在某个 agent 进不去的系统里。\n"}